<translation id="1425903838053942728">{COUNT,plural, =0{I-Taktak iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha.}=1{I-Taktak iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha. Iwindi lakho le-Incognito ngeke liphinde livuleke.}one{I-Taktak iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}other{I-Taktak iqedile ukuvuselela. Ungasebenzisa uhlobo lwakamuva ngokushesha nje lapho uqalisa kabusha. Ngemuva kwalokho, amathebhu akho amanje azovulwa kabusha. Amawindi akho angu-# e-Incognito ngeke aze aphinde avuleke.}}</translation>
