<translation id="2825024317344269723">Isayithi eyingozi. I-Taktak isuse izaziso.</translation>
<translation id="2841525013647267359">Humusha kusuka</translation>
<translation id="2846251086934905009">Iphutha lokufaka: Isifaki asiqedanga. Ukufakwa kukhanseliwe.</translation>
<translation id="2853415089995957805">I-Taktak ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi okungenzeka uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha lapho uwavakashela</translation>
