<translation id="2876628302275096482">Funda kabanzi mayelana <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />nokuthi i-Taktak igcina kanjani idatha yakho iyimfihlo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="2885378588091291677">Isiphathi somsebenzi</translation>
<translation id="2888126860611144412">Mayelana ne-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="2915996080311180594">Qala Kabusha Ngemuva Kwesikhathi</translation>
<translation id="2926676257163822632">Amaphasiwedi angaqinile aqageleka kalula. Vumela i-Taktak <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />ikudalele futhi ikhumbule amaphasiwedi aqinile<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
