<translation id="5126049312684316860">I-Taktak ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi engeziwe ongase uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha kakhudlwana lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="5132929315877954718">Thola izinhlelo zokusebenza ezinhle, amageyimu, izandiso namatimu e-Taktak Taktak.</translation>
<translation id="5139423532931106058">Yenza ngokwezifiso iphrofayela yakho ye-Taktak</translation>
