<translation id="5170938038195470297">Iphrofayela yakho ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa ngoba isuka kunguqulo entsha ye-Taktak Taktak.

Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingatholakali. Sicela ucacise umkhombandlela wephrofayela ehlukile noma usebenzise inguqulo entsha ye-Taktak.</translation>
<translation id="5174969993834422967">Uvamise ukuvimba izaziso. Ukuze uvumele leli sayithi ukuthi likwazise, chofoza isithonjana sesaziso ekhoneni elingakwesokudla lebha yendawo yakho.</translation>
<translation id="5201744974236816379">isibuyekezo se-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="521447420733633466">Uma wabelana ngedivayisi, abangane nomndeni bangaphequlula ngokwehlukile baphinde basethe i-Taktak ngendlela abayifunayo.</translation>
