<translation id="5649156266046089790">Ngamaphrofayela weChrome ungahlukanisa zonke izinto zakho zeChrome. Sungula amaphrofayela wabangane nomndeni, noma uhlukanise phakathi komsebenzi nobumnandi.</translation>
