<translation id="5858486459377137936">Uzophuma ngemvume emasayithini amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-Taktak, ngaphandle kwe-Taktak Account yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-Taktak. Ukuvumela amasayithi akukhumbule, <ph name="SETTINGS_LINK" />.</translation>
