<translation id="6008161919456049856">Amaphasiwedi akho, izindlela zokukhokha, namakheli owalondoloze kuGoogle Account yakho azosuswa kule divayisi. Ukuze uphinde uzisebenzise kuChrome, ngena ngemvume futhi.</translation>
