<translation id="604424701295382420">Kuphiniwe! Ungaphinde ufinyelele iGoogle Lens enkinobheni entsha kubha yamathuluzi</translation>
<translation id="6069027071882229820">Kopisha njengesithombe</translation>
<translation id="6070348360322141662">Ngokuvikela okungeziwe, i-Taktak Taktak izobethela idatha yakho</translation>
<translation id="6075300983329039771">Inhlangano yakho, ebizwa <ph name="MANAGER" />, ifuna ungene ngemvume kuChrome</translation>
