<translation id="6157638032135951407">Inhlangano yakho isula idatha ye-Taktak uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
