<translation id="8387459386171870978">Qhubeka nokusebenzisa i-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="8394720698884623075">Kuhlola ama-URL anohlu lwamasayithi angaphephile agcinwe ku-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="8403038600646341038">Ilogo ye-Taktak ngaphakathi kwesikrini sekhompyutha.</translation>
<translation id="8418845734693287262">I-ChromeOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho ngoba imininingwane yokungena ngemvume kwe-akhawunti yakho akusisesikhathini.</translation>
<translation id="842386925677997438">Amathuluzi okuphepha e-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="8425765582779547329">Ukuze uhlale uphephile ku-inthanethi ngokukhethwayo komzali wakho, ngena ngemvume kuChrome</translation>
<translation id="8433638294851456451">Ukuze uthumele inombolo kusukela lapha kufoni yakho ye-Android, ngena ngemvume ku-Taktak kuwo womabili amadivayisi.</translation>
<translation id="8496177819998570653">I-Taktak P&amp;assword Manager</translation>
<translation id="8498858610309223613">Isibuyekezo esibalulekile sokuvikela se-Taktak Taktak sisanda kusetshenziswa. Qalisa kabusha manje bese sizobuyisela amathebhu akho.</translation>
<translation id="8516431725144212809">Izintshisekelo zakho njengoba zilinganiselwe yi-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="8521348052903287641">Umyalo wokubophezeleka ngaphakathi kwe-beta ye-Taktak Taktak ukuze kuvunyelwe ithrafikhi ye-mDNS.</translation>
