<translation id="8555465886620020932">Iphutha lesevisi: <ph name="SERVICE_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="856656450041460113">Sesha uhlu lwezilimi</translation>
<translation id="8601359445272098721">Okusha! Ungahumusha kokubili umbhalo nezithombe esikrinini sakho ngokukhetha inkinobho ethi "humusha isikrini"</translation>
<translation id="8614913330719544658">I-Taktak Taktak ayiphenduli. Qalisa kabusha manje?</translation>
<translation id="861702415419836452">I-Taktak idinga imvume yokufinyelela kwikhamera yakho ukudala imephu engu-3D yendawo yakho ekuzungezile</translation>
<translation id="8625237574518804553">{0,plural, =1{I-Taktak izoqalisa kabusha kuminithi elingu-1}one{I-Taktak izoqalisa kabusha kumaminithi angu-#}other{I-Taktak izoqalisa kabusha kumaminithi angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="8637932705841171563">Ukuze wabelane ngewindi lakho, vumela ukurekhodwa kwesikrini kweChrome Kumasethingi Ohlelo.</translation>
<translation id="8641606876632989680">I-Taktak izokwazisa uma ungena ngemvume ngephasiwedi eyonakalisiwe</translation>
<translation id="8649026945479135076">Kujwayelekile ukuthi amasayithi owavakashelayo akhumbule izinto onentshisekelo kuzo, enze ukuzizwela kube ngokwezifiso. Amasayithi angagcina nolwazi nge-Taktak mayelana nezintshisekelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="8669527147644353129">Isisizi se-Taktak Taktak</translation>
<translation id="8679801911857917785">Iphinda ilawule ukuthi yiliphi ikhasi eliboniswayo uma uqala i-Taktak.</translation>
<translation id="8712637175834984815">Ngiyitholile</translation>
<translation id="8712767363896337380">Cishe isisesikhathini! Qalisa kabusha i-Taktak ukuqedela ukubuyekeza.</translation>
<translation id="8718062187489036808">Phuma ngemvume ku-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="8725440680697264016">Buza iGoogle ngale vidiyo</translation>
<translation id="873133009373065397">I-Taktak Taktak ayikwazi ukunquma noma isethe isiphequluli esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="8747073452963259673">ikhona elingezansi ngakwesokunxele lendawo yokusesha: ngakwesokudla okungu-<ph name="LEFT" />%, ngezansi okungu-<ph name="BOTTOM" />%</translation>
<translation id="8748735421235723888">IChrome ikhulula inkumbulo kumathebhu angasebenzi. Lokhu kunikeza amathebhu asebenzayo namanye ama-app izinsiza zekhompyutha ezengeziwe futhi kugcina iChrome ishesha. Amathebhu akho angasebenzi aphinde asebenze ngokuzenzekela uma ubuyela kuwo. <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />Funda kabanzi mayelana Nesilondolozi Senkumbulo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="8753189155654018347">Susa le datha yama-app kuChrome</translation>
<translation id="8765470054473112089">Uma uthayipha ibha yekheli noma ibhokisi losesho, i-Taktak ithumela lokho okuthayiphayo kunjini yakho yosesho yokuzenzakalelayo ukuze uthole iziphakamiso ezingcono. Lokhu kuvaliwe ku-Incognito.</translation>
<translation id="8781673607513845160">Ukuze usebenzise ikhamera yakho, nikeza iChrome ukufinyelela <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />amasethingi ohlelo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="878572486461146056">Iphutha lokufaka: Umlawuli wenethiwekhi yakho usebenzise Inqubomgomo Yeqembu evimbela ukufakwa: <ph name="INSTALL_ERROR" /></translation>
<translation id="8798550110818026746">Inhlangano yakho ingabona futhi ilawule idatha yopheqululo, efana namabhukhimakhi akho, umlando, namaphasiwedi. Ayikwazi ukubona idatha yokubhrawuza kwamanye amaphrofayela eChrome</translation>
<translation id="8821043148920470810">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Taktak Taktak, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="8823341990149967727">I-Taktak ingaphandle kwedethi</translation>
<translation id="8825634023950448068">Ukuze sivikele ubumfihlo bakho, sisula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho ezindala kunamaviki ama-4. Njengoba uqhubeka nokubhrawuza, intshisekelo ingase ivele ohlwini futhi. Futhi uma i-Taktak ikuthola kungalungile noma ungafuni ukubona izikhangiso ezithile, ungayisusa intshisekelo.</translation>
<translation id="8834965163890861871">I-Taktak Taktak izama ukuhlela amaphasiwedi. Thayipha amaphasiwedi akho e-Windows ukuze uvumele lokhu.</translation>
<translation id="8843516219908676469">IChrome iwaqonda kangcono amafomu futhi ingakugcwalisela wona ngokuzenzekelayo ngokushesha</translation>
<translation id="8851180723659088381">{NUM_EXTENSIONS,plural, =1{I-Taktak incoma ukuthi uyisuse}one{I-Taktak incoma ukuthi uzisuse}other{I-Taktak incoma ukuthi uzisuse}}</translation>
<translation id="8862326446509486874">Awunawo amalungelo afanele wokufakwa okukuleveli yesistimu. Zama ukuqalisa isifaki futhi njengomlawuli.</translation>
<translation id="8883862939660515976">Buza iGoogle Lens ngalesi sithombe</translation>
<translation id="8914504000324227558">Phinda uqalise i-Taktak</translation>
<translation id="8922193594870374009">Ukuze uthumele inombolo kusukela ku-<ph name="ORIGIN" /> kufoni yakho ye-Android, ngena ngemvume ku-Taktak kuwo womabili amadivayisi.</translation>
<translation id="8948460679427074738">Lesi sandiso asikashicileli izindlela zangasese zokuziphatha, njengokuthi siyiqoqa futhi siyisebenzise kanjani idatha. I-Taktak incoma ukuthi uyisuse.</translation>
<translation id="8958307504142971576">Manje unezakhi eziningi ezitholakala kuChrome</translation>
<translation id="8989968390305463310">Umlando wakho wokubhrawuza uthinta izikhangiso ozibonayo kanye nezinto ozishisakalelayo njengoba kulinganiselwa ngezansi. Ukuze ivikele ubumfihlo bakho, i-Taktak isula ngokuzenzakalelayo izintshisekelo zakho njalo ngenyanga. Izintshisekelo zingavuseleleka ngaphandle kwalapho uma uzisusa.</translation>
<translation id="8992769679401294069">Idatha yakho ibhalwe ngokufihla ngomushwana wokungena. Ifake ukuze usebenzise futhi wonge idatha ye-Taktak ku-akhawunti yakho ye-Taktak.</translation>
<translation id="8999117580775242387">Uma i-HTTPS ingatholakali, i-Taktak izosebenzisa uxhumo olungavikelekile ngaphandle kokukuxwayisa</translation>
<translation id="8999208279178790196">{0,plural, =0{Isibuyekezo se-Taktak siyatholakala}=1{Isibuyekezo se-Taktak siyatholakala}one{Isibuyekezo se-Taktak sitholakale izinsuku ezingu-#}other{Isibuyekezo se-Taktak sitholakale izinsuku ezingu-#}}</translation>
