<translation id="9195993889682885387">I-Taktak ingasikisela izinto ozithakaselayo ngokusekelwe kumlando wakho wokubhrawuza kusukela emavikini ambalwa adlule. Lolu lwazi luhlala kudivayisi yakho.</translation>
